+Research MUST NOT use browser automation. This applies to Main, every worker, retries, passage verification, recovery and current-field work. No BetterWright, Playwright, CDP, browser CLI, remote browser, curator or interactive authentication, even when a fetch fails. `/skill:fabric-research` revokes QA; continued/resumed research stays restricted. Do not change modes or tool grants as recovery.
